WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
Demolition in the past two years

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,880
Calculated based on homestead and per capita investment

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,560
Our family should pay 320,000

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,680
I want to build a new house for my grandpa that doesn’t miss a beat.

5
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,480
Leave the rest to me for review and medication.

6
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,600
In the end, only 30,000 came down

7
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,800
Grandpa goes to theory

8
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,240
I was pushed down the steps and my leg was broken.

9
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,680
Grandma is so anxious that her brain is bleeding

10
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:16,920
Half the body is greedy

11
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,240
I can't get out of bed now

12
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,360
Can't afford a lawsuit

13
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,880
The hospital collects bills every day

14
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,280
Can't read the book

15
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,560
I'll do odd jobs first

16
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,920
Not enough money for medicine

17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,680
Later, a fellow villager introduced me to this method.

18
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,520
Can I hire a caregiver for my grandma?

19
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:35,870
Can I get medicine for grandpa? Where is your home?

20
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:41,590
This script is wrong, it's okay

21
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:45,520
Just tell me, I'll politely accept it
